Third-party notices:

This plugin is an independent work for the DeepSeek Harness (DSH) plugin
system and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or derived from DeepSeek AI
or the DSH project.

The following open-source projects served as design/UX references only
(no source code was copied):

- archify — https://github.com/tt-a1i/archify (Apache-2.0):
  inspired the nested-card "knowledge map" presentation style.
- dsh-deepread — https://github.com/xiehuan123/dsh-deepread (MIT):
  inspired the "problem-driven, evidence-first" reading-report structure
  adopted by section digests and the companion skill.

The bundled sample textbook data (Signals and Systems, Zheng Junli, 3rd ed.,
in data/books/) is an original, independently written study summary
(restructured into JSON) and does not reproduce the textbook's text.
Educational use only; all trademarks belong to their respective owners.